# Walkthrough - MCQ Practice Service Data Integration

I have integrated real data from the database into the MCQ practice service, enabling users to select subjects, chapters, and topics with accurate question counts.

## Changes Made

### API Layer
- **[exam.ts](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/packages/api/src/routers/home/exam.ts)**:
    - Updated `getSubjectsWithChapters` to include topics within each chapter.
    - Added MCQ counts for each topic.
